By the way, Jared's xlogfile patch has some new fields available this 
year which we'd like to use:

1)	starting gender & alignment

	We'll be using these this year instead of the ending gender and 
alignment NetHack logs, so all the trophies that depend on your gender 
and alignment will now force you to start differently (rather than, as 
was pointed out, merely changing them before ascending).

2)	three new achievements: the Mines, Sokoban and Medusa

	These will be added into the Star series; it's not obvious where they 
should fall exactly, but we're currently planning on:

	Dilithium	ascended
	Platinum	astral
	Gold		elemental
	Silver		amulet
	Bronze		invocation
	Steel		book
	Brass		candelabrum
	Copper		gehennom
	Zinc		medusa
	Iron		bell
	Lead		mines
	Plastic		sokoban

I'm pretty certain Medusa is in the right place in the sequence but I 
think it would also make sense for the Mines to be Plastic (since 
they're technically an unnecessary side branch and not art of the main 
sequence).

It's still possible to change them, though, so please post your easons 
if you disagree.

Thanks,
-robin


